  "description": "NESKEE crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C93 H93 Ho7 O38,6(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho4 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho5 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho6 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho7 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 11 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.549-3.878 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 91.63-111.20°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C105H111Ho7N6O38. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
